# Formatting rules for eul.
#
# The Xcode lint phase runs SwiftFormat over $SRCROOT with no configuration, so
# without this file the tool falls back to its own defaults. Since 0.55 those
# defaults space range operators, rewriting this codebase's half-open ranges
# from `0..<n` to `0 ..< n` — a build would silently reformat unrelated code.
# Pin the project's house style here instead.

--ranges no-space
